@startuml cerrarSesion-diseño
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Cerrar Sesión

actor "Coordinador" as Coordinador
participant "Navegador\n(Thymeleaf)" as View
participant "CerrarSesionController\n(@Controller)" as Controller
participant "Spring Security" as Security

== Mostrar confirmación ==

Coordinador -> View: Click en "Cerrar sesión"
activate View
View -> Controller: GET /cerrar-sesion
activate Controller
Controller --> View: cerrar-sesion.html
deactivate Controller
View --> Coordinador: Muestra pantalla de confirmación
deactivate View

== Confirmar cierre ==

Coordinador -> View: Click en "Confirmar"
activate View
View -> Security: POST /logout
activate Security
Security -> Security: invalidarSesion()
Security --> View: redirect: GET /login?logout
deactivate Security
View --> Coordinador: Formulario de login\n("Sesión cerrada correctamente")
deactivate View

== Cancelar cierre ==

Coordinador -> View: Click en "Cancelar"
activate View
View --> Coordinador: redirect: GET /panel
deactivate View

@enduml
